# CP01 Scope Rules

## Active checkpoint

CP01 is focused on BARAKUDA v1 laboratory deployment and PhD Talent acceleration.

## Allowed work in CP01

- v1 app split preparation (Acquisition mode vs Analysis mode)
- deployment preparation
- timing audit
- batch summary hardening
- report consistency and reporting safety improvements
- documentation and project governance
- tests and validation scaffolding

## Forbidden work for now

- viscoelasticity expansion
- Raman modules
- IR modules
- AFM expansion beyond CP01-safe stabilization
- hydrogel cooling material modules
- BARAKUDA v2 implementation
- broad UI redesign
